  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a blender or food processor, combine soy sauce, lime juice, garlic, cumin, coriander, salt, black pepper, and ají amarillo peppers. Blend until smooth.",
    "Place the chicken in a large zip-top plastic bag or a shallow dish. Pour the marinade over the chicken and seal or cover.",
